# race-pause: the in-race PAUSE menu, mid-race (plan S6 replay).
# Needs --ini debug.autodrive=1 (the CPU drives player 1, so the
# race is still running when START opens the pause box).
# Ticks 0-3299: race-gp-finish's walk (GP, JACK cup, MUTE CITY).
# 5000 START: pause box opens (scissor wipe), cursor on CONTINUE.
# DOWN x5: Retry, Settings, Quit, (wrap) Continue, Retry; UP x5
# back to Continue (GP lists 4 options), A: unpause, race resumes.
# 7000 START again, DOWN to RETRY, A: the GP restarts the race
# (retry transition, course intro, countdown) to the end.
# SHOTs hand-placed on the pause screens (this is not a covsched
# corpus replay; tools/dev/replays like the ek-* files).
build ni-strict-census@bbd92ab
seed1 0x1234abcd
seed2 0x0fedcba9
pins renderthread=0 det=1 autodrive=1
at 400
press START 15 0
at 800
press A 15 0
at 1100
press A 15 0
at 1400
press A 15 0
at 1700
press A 15 0
at 2000
press A 15 0
